window.products.push({"id":157060,"name":"ecozy Nugget Ice Maker Countertop - Chewable Pellet Ice Cubes, 33 lbs Daily Output, Stainless Steel Housing, Self-Cleaning Ice Machine with Ice Bags f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V9D5hfe9L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crunchy & Munchable Ice - Looking for the ultimate drink experience? The ecozy nugget ice maker serves up chewable and crunchy nugget ice. Unlike bullet ice and square cubes, nugget ice melts slowly and cools drinks quickly, preserving the original flavor of cocktails and other beverages. 7 oz of Ice in 20 Mins - The new type of extrusion ice maker exhibits exceptional ice production efficiency! Get 7oz soft and crunchy cubes ready in 20 mins for your drinks. It produces enough ice for 3-5 drinks in an hour, perfect for home use. No more hassle of going to the store for ice - get the perfect ice anytime! Big Output, Small Footprint - Get the most compact pellet ice maker - only 11.3x8.6x12.6in! Unlike other larger ice makers with smaller output（24 lbs), this one produces up to 33 lbs of ice per day. Not only suitable for installation on various countertops but also suitable for going out and camping! Effortless Self-cleaning - The Self-cleaning feature thoroughly cleans every nook and cranny of the ice maker with circulating water. You can enjoy healthy and fresh nugget ice at any time. We suggest washing the machine before long-term storage and ensuring it is dry inside. Store Ice in Fridge - If the ice cubes in the basket are not used for a while, they will melt. Use the included ice bags and scoop to transfer them to the refrigerator for later use About NOISE - Ecozy verified in an absolutely silent laboratory that the noise level is below 43dB (at a distance of 1m). If you use it in a normal environment, the noise level can increase to 50-60dB due to environmental noise and the distance to the ice maker, which is a normal phenomenon. And the noise will gradually diminish with continued usage and component alignment. Tips for Optimizing Ice-Making Efficiency - 1. Ensure that the machine is placed in a location where the room temperature is below 81°F (27°C) and shielded from direct sunlight. 2. Maintain a 6 inches (15 cm) clearance around the machine for proper heat dissipation. 3. Accelerate ice production by using ice water at around 4°C (39°F).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71V9D5hfe9L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ecozy","source_asin":"B0BWQR1YBP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-157060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWQR1YBP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWQR1YBP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
