window.products.push({"id":157062,"name":"TOVECARE 120Pcs Aluminum Foil Seals Lids for Reusable Nespresso VertuoLine Pods, 63mm Aluminum Foil Lids Stickers Compatible with Nespresso Vertuoline","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UFTxgs1PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-quality material: Our self-adhesive aluminum foil lids are custom-made from thick aluminum foil material, which is different from ordinary aluminum foil on the market. They are not easily broken, made from food-grade material, 100% recyclable, and pollution-free. Easy to use: Remove the old aluminum foil lid from the reusable Nespresso capsule, clean and dry the reusable Nespresso Vertuo capsule, fill it with your own coffee powder, position the lid in the middle, and press the edge to seal it. Our aluminum foil lid is slightly larger than the pod opening of the capsule, and the excess edge can be wrapped under the pod opening for a better sealing effect. You can make multiple coffee capsules at once to save time. Cost-effective and eco-friendly: Make your own coffee capsules with your own coffee powder instead of buying expensive coffee capsules. You can choose your favorite flavor and save money. Reuse Nespresso capsules instead of throwing them away to reduce environmental impact. Widely compatible: Our 63mm aluminum foil stickers are compatible with Nespresso Vertuo Line machines. They are not compatible with Nespresso Original Line coffee machines. Please check and confirm before purchasing. Customer service: You will receive 120 VertuoLine coffee pod aluminum foil lids (Note: Nespresso Vertuoline capsules are not included). If you have any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to send a message to us via Amazon, and we will reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UFTxgs1PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOVECARE","source_asin":"B0BVYYY261","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-157062","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVYYY261","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVYYY261","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
