window.products.push({"id":157416,"name":"Dryer Repair Kit for Samsung Drum Roller Kit DC97-16782A,Dryer Belt 6602-001655,Idler Pulley DC93-00634A,Replacement AP5325135 PS4221885 AP4373659 PS4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YOa9PwgVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dryer Repair Kit for Samsung Dryer Include: 4 x Dryer Roller DC97-16782A 1 x Dryer Drive Belt 6602-001655 1 x Dryer Idler Pulley DC93-00634A (include 1pc screw) AP5325135 Dryer Repair Kit works on almost all samsung dryers,such as dv45h7000ew/a2 dv40J3000ew/a2(gw), dv48h7400ew, dv50K8600ev dv42h5600ep, dv42h5000ew, dv45k7600ew, dv48j7770ep, dv52j8700ep, dv210aew/xaa, see the list of more models in the sixth and seventh pictures. DC97-16782A drum support roller and axle, which includes the roller shaft and mounting clips, is used in dryers. This part holds the drum as it rotates on the support wheels. When the roller begins to wear out, it self lubricates, so no additional grease is needed. If your dryer is making odd noises then checking and replacing the rollers can be the solution to your problem. DC93-00634A Dryer Idler Pulley includes the idler arm and the idler pulley that maintains tension on the drive belt, allowing the belt to turn.High quality and durable performance,Silent and smooth dual bearing. 6602-001655 Dryer drum belt goes between the dryer motor and dryer drum. It attaches to a pulley system and turns the drum during a cycle. When this part tears or snaps, your dryer won't work like it should.This is an easy repair and should only take a few minutes. This Dryer belt kit for Samsung Fix the following symptoms: Dryer will not start Dryer is squeaky or noisy Dryer won’t tumble or spin Installation tips: 1)Disconnect the dryer from the power supply before replace parts. 2)You'll need work gloves to protect your hands. 3)Some extra space for spare parts, and a screwdriver to fix them. 4)Watch YouTube install video online to find out how to fix it.Also, you can take pictures before you remove each piece so that you won't forget how to install new parts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YOa9PwgVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOOTOP","source_asin":"B08JVDQGLL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-157416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JVDQGLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JVDQGLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
