window.products.push({"id":157545,"name":"Rhino Coffee Gear 600mm Pitcher Rinser, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T3DIK9Q1L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Rhino Coffee Gear's new pitcher rinser design brings with it a number of features you have been asking for! Better Drainage - The 3 piece drain tray has an improved design to ensure there is no static build-up of residue along with a generous drain outlet. Bigger Vessels - The large actuator plate makes it useful across a broader range of equipment. Multiple Rinser Positions - The RHPR600 has an extra position allowing you to move the rinser to the center or leave at one end. With the 3 piece grate design, this makes it very adaptive to many environments and allows for best orientation. Another idea is to put an additional rinser in place, this option is great for busy cafes or to allow for dedicated purpose – for example use one sprayer for milk and the other with spin jet for tea plungers (watch out for our blender adapter coming soon). Optional Spin jet Spray Mechanism - The new spin jet valve sprays and spins at the same time creating a more robust mechanical cleaning action than normal rinsing valves. It is ideal for plungers using tea & coffee grounds, milk and other residues that tend to hold firm. Click here for me details on this piece. Install Parts included with each rinser you will find some fittings and hoses to make installation easier ( 3/8 push fit inlet plus elbow option, 1 meter of inlet hose and drain hose with clip). NSF Certified - All Rhino Coffee Gear Milk Pitcher Rinsers are NSF Certified. Dimensions (approx): 238mm (W) x 600mm (L) (9. 38 in x 23. 6 in)Drain Hose: 25mm/1mm sizeDepth Requirements: The Rhino rinsers are 1. 57\" deep, however, this is without fittings. We recommend at least 6\" of clearance under the bench for basic connection (this includes fall for the drain hose). The actual depth may differ depending on the location of the drain, the location of the water supply, or whether you use an elbow or a straight connector.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T3DIK9Q1L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rhino Coffee Gear","source_asin":"B07C79X8TB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-157545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C79X8TB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C79X8TB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
