window.products.push({"id":157683,"name":"Dryer drum roller wpw10314173 8536974 roller drum support kit with Tri-Rings Replaces 8536973, WPW10314173, AP6019303, W10314173, W10314171,3396802 fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a+wgqTMEL._AC_SL1030_.jpg","description":"👨‍🔧[ Package List&Material ] This may-tag dryer drum roller kit included 4* wpw10314173 rollers with tri-rings. We have upgraded the material and increased the thickness of the wheel rubber, more durable, longer life and better silence.By repairing rather than buying a new one, it is a good way of life that can restore your dryer to work 👨‍🔧[ Problem-solving ] When your dryer makes noise, marks left on clothes, and the dryer will not tumble, you need to check whether these dryer drum rollers are damaged. Most dryers require two drum rollers. It is recommended to check and replace both drum support rollers at the same time to ensure proper drum rotation and because they often wear at the same rate 👨‍🔧[ Replacement part numbers ] This wpw10314173 roller drum support kit replaces AP6019303, 3388342, 3389902, 3396801, 3396802, 3401846, 8536973, 8536974, W10314171, W10314173, W10756057, WPW10314173VP dryer rollers. Notices: 8536974 can replaces WPW10314173 ,their color is different. 👨‍🔧[ Perfect Fit ] This wpw10314173 roller drum support kit works on Dryer, Washer Dryer Combo, Compatible with whirl-pool may-tag ken-more Dryer 👨‍🔧[ Quality Assurance ] Before delivery, we checked the quality of this dryer drum roller kit and have been fully tested the manufacturer to conduct a comprehensive test to ensure that the may-tag dryer parts received by each customer can be used normally.Fifteen year guarantee - if you find these dryer drum rollers replacement quality problems during use, please contact us. We will solve your problems within 12 hours and replace the new Dryer parts free of charge","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a+wgqTMEL._AC_SL1030_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Semzohc","source_asin":"B0BRCLLWMJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-157683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRCLLWMJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRCLLWMJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":157684,"name":"241993101 Refrigerator Crisper Cover Support Premium Replacement Part by Canamax - Compatible with Frigidaire & Kenmore Refrigerators - Replaces AP442","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51J1clfKi4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE REPLACEMENT PART YOU NEED FOR YOUR REFRIGERATOR Functions The 241993101 Refrigerator Crisper Cover Support used to keep the crisper shelf in place and may need replacing if the door will not open or close. This white, OEM part measures roughly 1 inch in diameter and can be used for the front and the rear support, as designed by the manufacturer, and mounts to the inside cabinet wall. Replacing this part is an easy repair, and will require a small flat blade screwdriver, a putty knife, and a soft hammer. Remove the crisper and shelf from the refrigerator before replacing the support. The crisper cover front support is held in place with a locking pin. To remove the old part, you will first need to push the pin into the interior of the cabinet using the screwdriver, and then you can pull the support out with a putty knife. If you cannot get the pin out you can use a flat-blade screwdriver to push it down and out of sight and it will not harm anything in your refrigerator. After removing the pin and attaching the new support, simply use the soft hammer to lock the new pin in place. Replaces part numbers : AP4427109, 1513082, 240423701, 7241993101 Wide compatibility The perfect fit for most top brand names (Frigidaire, Kenmore, Crosley, Electrolux) Worry-free in getting these replacement parts as they are a perfect match for your refrigerator. Solve your following problems Door won’t open or close  Unfresh food Search no further!! Click Add to Cart to get these refrigerator replacement parts The Frigidaire brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the Frigidaire brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51J1clfKi4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Canamax","source_asin":"B0B3CF9L9X","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-157684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3CF9L9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3CF9L9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
