window.products.push({"id":157738,"name":"Kegco HBK199B-2 Keg Dispenser, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vDW2okqfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INCLUDES COMPLETE KEG TAPPING KIT: This kegerator comes with a direct draft kit that has been completely outfitted with everything you will need to begin dispensing your homebrew beer from a keg - you just provide the keg of beer! This kit includes the premium versions of our polished stainless steel dual faucet draft beer tower, dual gauge CO2 regulator, and 5 lb. aluminum CO2 tank with corrosion resistant red coating all at the standard prices, adding a $37 value to your order. LARGE INTERIOR: Store and dispense from up to two 5-gallon home-brew kegs at the same time thanks to this kegerator's spacious interior, which allows you to have a variety of beers on tap for your friends and family. This versatile kegerator can also be used as an all-refrigerator when you need additional storage space for food and beverages. It comes with two adjustable shelves that can be placed far enough apart to hold two liter bottles or gallon jugs. SLEEK AND STYLISH DESIGN: This kegerator's black cabinet is fitted with a matte black door that is not only stylish, but is also less prone to show fingerprints and smudges. Cleaning your kegerator is easier than ever thanks to the removable and dishwasher-safe drip tray that catches drips and spills for fast clean-up, as well as the chrome guard rail that keeps mugs and glasses from falling off of the top. Four rolling casters provide convenient mobility. POWERFUL AND ENERGY EFFICIENT COOLING TECHNOLOGY: This keg cooler features a 25% more energy efficient design that delivers powerful cooling while causing minimal impact to the environment - and your wallet. It utilizes thermostatic temperature control that lets you adjust the internal temperature, allowing you to dispense your beer at its ideal temperature. The temperature can be adjusted using a mechanical dial that is conveniently located inside of the cabinet. PLEASE NOTE: This is a homebrew kegerator and includes ball lock keg couplers for home brew kegs; it will not tap commercial D system kegs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vDW2okqfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kegco","source_asin":"B019RKIJ56","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-157738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019RKIJ56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B019RKIJ56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
