window.products.push({"id":157740,"name":"Winado Portable Countertop Dishwasher, Mini Dish Washer with 5 Washing Programs, 5L Built-in Water Tank, Air-dry & Delay Function, Fruit Washing for A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31vklr3XOCL._AC_.jpg","description":"【5 WASHING PROGRAMS】 The compact dishwasher features 5 washing modes (normal, ECO, intensive, rapid and fruit wash) to choose according to different tableware and food residue. Lower and upper spray arms give dishes that streak-free deep cleaning. And the water temperature can be as high as 161.6°F to achieve disinfection effect. At the same time, there is also ultraviolet sterilization. 【COMPACT DESIGN】 This countertop dishwasher measures 17.7L\" x 17.3\"W x 18\"H, which is compact to take little space and easy to carry anywhere. The machine can fit a variety of dishes (up to 12-inches in diameter at an angle) and is ideal for small-sized houses, apartments, dorms, boats and campers/RVs. 【2 WATER SUPPLY MODES】 This dishwasher supports 2 water supply modes for you to choose, including water tank mode and faucet mode. In order to maximize portability and storage, you just fill the built-in 5 L/ 1.3 Gallon water tank as needed without a water hookup. And an inlet hose is included to connect the kitchen faucet for direct water supply. (adapter not included) 【DRY MODE & DELAY FUNCTION】 With PTC hot air drying mode, the dishwasher will keep the dishes clean and dry. It works 90mins each alternate 12hrs and turned off after 163.5hrs. Moreover, delay function (1-12 hours optional) operates with a washing mode, allowing you to set appointed time to wash. 【COMPLETE ACCESSORIES】 The compact countertop dishwasher comes with 1 tableware basket, 1 chopsticks box, 1 fruit basket, 1 measuring cup, 1 water inlet pipe, 1 drainage pipe, 1 drainage pipe clamp and 1 suction pad.Made of food-grade ABS material for safe use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31vklr3XOCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winado","source_asin":"B0B9H7V92K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-157740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9H7V92K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9H7V92K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
