window.products.push({"id":157919,"name":"HomeBrewStuff Super Efficient 3/8\" x 25' Copper Wort Chiller with Recirculating Arm and Compression Fittings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gtqM+wSnL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you’re tired of wasting time stirring your wort chiller to speed up the cooling process, you might want to try recirculation instead. Not only is it faster it is much more efficient with constant continues recirculation. This immersion chiller features a recirculation arm attached to one of our Chillers, making our best-selling chiller even more effective than ever before. Recirculating you wort can also bring out more hop flavor and wonderful aromas in your IPAs, which is something that every brewer can appreciate. This Immersion Chiller features 1/2\" MPT fitting on the recirculation arm to accommodate a barb, a nipple, or a quick disconnect fitting for more customized connections and easier attachments. Its water inlet is 3/4\" female garden hose thread, while the water outlet is 3/4\" male garden hose thread. This makes it easy to attach the chiller to just about any common water source. With high quality 3/8\" copper piping throughout 1/2\" MPT fitting on the recirculation arm. Its water inlet is 3/4\" female garden hose thread, water outlet is 3/4\" male garden hose thread. Copper has up to 28 times the thermal conductivity of Stainless steel . So while we all love Stainless Steel, Copper is clearly much more efficient, and has the added benefit of imparting trace minerals into your beer that are beneficial to yeast . Thermal conductivity calculated by (Btu/(hr. °F ft.)) Copper 231 Stainless steel 8.1. 3/8\" Copper, 25' length.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gtqM+wSnL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Brew Stuff","source_asin":"B01BFPUPAI","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-157919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BFPUPAI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BFPUPAI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
